  "evidenceBoundary": {
    "direct": "The preparation helper reads decoder -> primary owner -> stored source, transports the upper halfword of the source argument into a separate flags descriptor, and passes the address of the decoder provider output field to a singleton virtual call.",
    "conditional": "Outside the alternate source-kind branch, source flag bit 9 selects the stored data pointer versus stored numeric word in a temporary descriptor; source flag bit 8 supplies a separate Boolean field. The alternate branch instead passes an owner-held pointer and word to another singleton slot.",
    "unresolved": "Indirect slot implementation and concrete provider identity, file opening, codec meaning of the argument halfword, decoder allocation generation, live selector-to-provider continuity and audible output are not established by this contract."
